camels:
The mocking-bird left off to mock;
Huge camels knelt as if
In deprecation;

camellia:
frozen lily-leaf,
camellia texture,
colder than a rose;

of grape and pomegranate,
the red camellia,
the most, most red rose;

camest:
Then a light within the gloom;
Thou, Love, camest to my side,
And the gates flew open wide.

camelot:
Was commonplace to Lady Guenever;
And Camelot to minstrels seemed as flat,
As Regent Street to poets.
